<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Intl Paper cut by Morgan Stanley.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Intl Paper cut by Morgan Stanley.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it cut its rating on International Paper Co to neutral from outperform on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Shares slipped 1/4 to 55-3/4 in early trading Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- The company said on Tuesday it planned to slash its workforce by 9,000 and sell off $1 billion of its assets.</p>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley analyst Matt Berler was not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
